{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05500","headline":"赋得岸花临水发 · 包融","name":"赋得岸花临水发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笑笑傍溪花，丛丛逐岸斜。\n朝开川上日，夜发浦中霞。\n照灼如临镜，䒠茸胜浣纱。\n春来武陵道，几树落仙家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}